        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6b361407-9f8c-48d5-8169-2e9cabd9e3a5).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rThree soldiers under the command of General Zaydan has been diverting military arms to the black markets.\r\rOur client — a senior officer is prepared to cut the problem out of the chain of command, but he insists the matter remain internal and the Army’s reputation unscathed. He wants those responsible removed and the final scene to read as a bungled arms transfer — an accident that ends the smuggling ring and buries any trail back to the brass.",
